{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-1",
      "transcript": "This tanker reached Malta with a warship lashed to each side.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.075,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.1",
      "samples": 97800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-2",
      "transcript": "It was August nineteen forty-two. Malta was under siege, and desperately short of fuel.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 4.4,
      "duration": 5.975,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.2",
      "samples": 143400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Ohio was carrying thousands of tons.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 10.666666666666666,
      "duration": 2.825,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.3",
      "samples": 67800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-4",
      "transcript": "A torpedo struck. Bomb attacks followed. Her engines failed, and water flooded in.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 13.8,
      "duration": 5.825,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.4",
      "samples": 139800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Towing her was a struggle: the damaged ship kept swinging off course.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 19.933333333333334,
      "duration": 4.3,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.5",
      "samples": 103200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-6",
      "transcript": "So destroyers came alongside, securing the tanker between them, while other vessels helped with the tow.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 24.533333333333335,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.6",
      "samples": 156000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-7",
      "transcript": "On August fifteenth, Ohio entered Grand Harbour.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 31.433333333333334,
      "duration": 3.675,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.7",
      "samples": 88200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Her fuel was unloaded, helping Malta’s aircraft keep fighting.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 35.5,
      "duration": 4.375,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.8",
      "samples": 105000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-9",
      "transcript": "The precious part of this wreck was still inside her.",
      "file": "audio/ohio/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 40.2,
      "duration": 3.15,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "ohio-pedestal.asset.arrival.script.9",
      "samples": 75600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
